{"id":"c30","stage":4,"title":"工作与生活","scene":"比较制度效果与实施条件。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c30-1","ko":"근무 시간을 줄이면 생산성이 떨어질까요?","zh":"缩短工作时间会降低生产效率吗？","note":"以问题引入因果关系讨论。","words":[{"term":"근무","zh":"工作；值勤","id":"e0166281024853dc","audio":"/audio/e0166281024853dc55a5.mp3"},{"term":"생산성","zh":"生产效率","id":"97e833011434e342","audio":"/audio/97e833011434e3421f69.mp3"},{"term":"떨어지다","zh":"下降","id":"5360fef914150d39","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/b96894b5aee1f389ff7a.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"근무","meaning":"工作","explanation":"근무（工作、值勤）修饰시간。","readings":[{"term":"근무","audio":"/audio/e0166281024853dc55a5.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"근무","audio":"/audio/e0166281024853dc55a5.mp3"}},{"text":"시간을","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간（时间）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"시간을","audio":"/audio/ef64a5c202c601ff5d8d.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간을","audio":"/audio/ef64a5c202c601ff5d8d.mp3"}},{"text":"줄이면","meaning":"缩短的话","explanation":"줄이다（减少）+ -면（条件）。","readings":[{"term":"줄이면","audio":"/audio/105447ee44ce8bc9e666.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄이면","audio":"/audio/105447ee44ce8bc9e666.mp3"}},{"text":"생산성이","meaning":"生产效率","explanation":"생산성（生产率）+ 이（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"생산성","audio":"/audio/97e833011434e3421f69.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생산성이","audio":"/audio/c6214f4df54da3c3491b.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어질까요?","meaning":"会下降吗？","explanation":"떨어지다（下降）+ -ㄹ까요（询问推测）。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어질까요","audio":"/audio/d2b2055b0cc0f8f35b55.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c30-2","ko":"반드시 그렇다고 보기는 어려워요.","zh":"很难说一定会如此。","note":"-다고 보기 어렵다 是谨慎的判断。","words":[{"term":"반드시","zh":"一定","id":"fcea2b562aa31758","audio":"/audio/fcea2b562aa3175866f7.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/765de22cba62bdcabfdf.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"반드시","meaning":"一定","explanation":"반드시表示必然。","readings":[{"term":"반드시","audio":"/audio/fcea2b562aa3175866f7.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반드시","audio"